abstract: >-
  QCV-Dataset is the first multimodal quantum circuit benchmark for evaluating
  AI systems on visual circuit understanding and code generation. It contains
  132 circuits across 13 categories (1-10 qubits) with 5 core modalities:
  circuit diagram images, executable code (Braket and Qiskit), simulation
  results, structured annotations, and annotated failure cases. Includes
  792 experiment results with cost analysis across three model tiers.
